      "quote": "When expanding (a + b)^n, the term with a^(n-r) b^r becomes",
      "claim": "When expanding (a+b)^n, the term with a^(n-r) b^r becomes nCr a^(n-r) b^r. Side notes label the exponent of the bracket's first term (a, shown as 'Exponent of ( )') and 'Exponent of b'.",
